, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn8le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Terri from Boston asks, \"Yesterday, I grabbed an umbrella and opened it inside and one of my friends freaked out saying I was not supposed to do that because it is bad luck.  Why?\"", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Terri,<br/> If I knew the answer, I would tell you. Unfortunately, I didn't have time to research this topic because I was just too busy.  I was supposed to read a bunch of e-mails this week, but I had to get fitted for my Halloween costume. <br/>\nI was also supposed to decorate my house for Halloween and I was supposed to get the decorations from a friend, but he went out of town on business. So, I had to go buy my own. If we weren't good friends, I would be angry at him. I always said if I won the lottery, I would buy a big house and now that I have one, it takes a long time to decorate.", "id": 2, "time": "12000", "image": "engenn8le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Then, I had to carve some pumpkins.<br/>\nMy dad and I were supposed to do it on Tuesday, but he was feeling sick, so I had to do all twenty of them myself.  Why twenty? Again, I said if I had a lot of money, I would buy a lot of pumpkins and donate them to a local charity. Unfortunately, the charity didn't want to carve them. So, I had to do it and it took up a lot of time.  If they weren't a charity for kids, I would be more upset.<br/><br/>Sorry, Terri.", "id": 3, "time": "45000", "image": "engenn8le17ob07re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le17ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le17ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}